#   This local development utility provides one read-only entry point for
#   syntax checks, coding-style checks, PHP compatibility analysis, PHPStan,
#   and PHPUnit.  It deliberately uses the tools installed on the local
#   system and does not install dependencies or modify project source files.
#   Any checks whose required tools are not available are reported and skipped.
#
#   With no path arguments, ccheck performs the normal complete check and
#   runs PHPUnit under the minimum and default PHP interpreters.  Path
#   arguments limit source analysis to those paths; tests are then run only
#   when test files are among the selected paths or a test-related option is
